From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt Community <openwrt-devel@lists.openwrt.org>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: realtek: rtl8365mb: add RTL8367SC EXT1/SDS1 support

Add per-instance SerDes/PCS handling for family D EXT1 (SDS1, port 7)
on RTL8367SC so 2500base-x links on EXT1 can be brought up correctly.

Program EXT1 serdes using SDS index 15 and SDS1_MISC0, clearing 0x1305
GMII_1 and TOP_CON0 MAC7_SEL_EXT1 for serdes modes as per vendor RTL8367D
behavior, and apply indirect SDS configuration.

Also fix SDS1_MISC0 PA enable bit positions (PA33PC_EN_S1=BIT(10),
PA12PC_EN_S1=BIT(9)) for EXT1 SerDes mode configuration.

---
 drivers/net/dsa/realtek/rtl8365mb_main.c | 693 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 309 insertions(+), 384 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/net/dsa/realtek/rtl8365mb_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/realtek/rtl8365mb_main.c
@@ -361,6 +361,7 @@
 
